PaymentRails_ConfigureTokenNative
├── when the module does not expose supportsNativeInput
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ModuleDoesNotSupportNative
├── when the module is any existing ERC20 module
│   ├── it should revert for ForwardModule
│   ├── it should revert for DexSwapModule
│   ├── it should revert for CowSwapModule
│   ├── it should revert for CCTPBridgeModule
│   └── it should revert for UnwrapModule
├── when the module reports no native support
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ModuleDoesNotSupportNative
├── when the module supports native input
│   ├── it should store the configuration under NATIVE_TOKEN
│   └── it should emit TokenConfigured
└── when clearing the native configuration
    └── it should succeed with a zero module
